Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: valkey_fdw
Comment: libvalkey is linked statically, so the binary package contains
 libvalkey code and not merely calls into it. libvalkey is not part of this
 source package - debian/rules fetches it at the pinned revision during the
 build - but BSD-3-Clause clause 2 binds whoever ships the resulting binary,
 so its notice is recorded here alongside this project's own terms.
 .
 There is no Source field because there is no published address to name, and
 a plausible-looking one would state a provenance the package does not have.

Files: *
Copyright: 2026, The valkey_fdw contributors
License: PostgreSQL

